window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-068-2d021e314b682f0f.json"]={sha256:"2d021e314b682f0f630ed4ab82fa151b2992267762667cd90ac8703209e342ed",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-dbdfdc65afb852fe","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5357","title":"RFC 5357: A Two-Way Active Measurement Protocol (TWAMP)","titleEn":"RFC 5357: A Two-Way Active Measurement Protocol (TWAMP)","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-068","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-068","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-069","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8762"],"title":"STAMP：序號、重排與丟失估計","titleEn":"STAMP: sequence numbers, reordering and loss estimation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受非負26/21 ms；沒有同步與額外假設不得報告各為13/10.5 ms單向。 交接時須能核對：交付 twamp-timestamps.csv、時鐘offset不變性測試及駐留分析。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Accept nonnegative26/21 ms; without synchronization and assumptions, do not report13/10.5 ms one-way. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver twamp-timestamps.csv, clock-offset invariance tests and residence analysis.","difference":"建立session、seq、send time、arrival time，分別統計準時、晚到、重複及未回覆。","differenceEn":"Record session, sequence and timestamps and separately count timely, late, duplicate and absent replies.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["TWAMP可提供反射器收送時間；扣除駐留得到網路往返量仍不等於可拆成精確單向延遲。\n教學基準：30-4 = 26 ms network round trip；對照：30-9 = 21 ms network round trip。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","STAMP量測需以session及序號關聯；重排和重複回覆不能直接當丟失或額外成功。\n教學基準：(100-95)/100*100 = 5 %；對照：(100-98)/100*100 = 2 %。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["TWAMP reflector timestamps expose residence time; subtracting residence gives network round trip, not automatically exact one-way delays.\nTeaching baseline: 30-4 = 26 ms network round trip; comparison: 30-9 = 21 ms network round trip. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","STAMP measurements join by session and sequence; reordered or duplicate replies are not automatically losses or extra successes.\nTeaching baseline: (100-95)/100*100 = 5 %; comparison: (100-98)/100*100 = 2 %. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-078","referenceUrls":["https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/"],"title":"I/Q 接收機：EVM 的平方和與誤差來源","titleEn":"I/Q receiver: EVM energy sums and error mechanisms","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受非負26/21 ms；沒有同步與額外假設不得報告各為13/10.5 ms單向。 交接時須能核對：交付 twamp-timestamps.csv、時鐘offset不變性測試及駐留分析。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Accept nonnegative26/21 ms; without synchronization and assumptions, do not report13/10.5 ms one-way. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver twamp-timestamps.csv, clock-offset invariance tests and residence analysis.","difference":"能推導並解釋5 %與10 %，建立iq_energy.csv、誤差向量圖、校正設定紀錄，並完成以下驗收：題設8%門檻僅第一組通過；報告校正設定，避免把共同相位補償後數字與未補償者比較。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 5 % and 10 %; create iq_energy.csv, error-vector plot and correction settings; apply this acceptance decision: Only the first case meets the teaching8% limit; disclose correction settings before comparing measurements.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["TWAMP可提供反射器收送時間；扣除駐留得到網路往返量仍不等於可拆成精確單向延遲。\n教學基準：30-4 = 26 ms network round trip；對照：30-9 = 21 ms network round trip。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","從原理 EVMrms=sqrt(sum(abs(error)²)/sum(abs(reference)²))；須先定義參考星座及是否校正共同增益與相位。 展開基準式 sqrt(0.25/100)*100；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：用四個等能量誤差子群加總，重現總能量；把EVM平方回去應還原0.0025及0.01。 將兩條推導一起存入 iq_energy.csv、誤差向量圖、校正設定紀錄。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["TWAMP reflector timestamps expose residence time; subtracting residence gives network round trip, not automatically exact one-way delays.\nTeaching baseline: 30-4 = 26 ms network round trip; comparison: 30-9 = 21 ms network round trip. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Starting from RMS EVM is sqrt(sum(abs(error)²)/sum(abs(reference)²)); define the reference constellation and common gain/phase correction first., expand baseline expression sqrt(0.25/100)*100; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Sum four equal-energy error subgroups; squaring EVM as a ratio must recover0.0025 and0.01. Save both derivations with iq_energy.csv, error-vector plot and correction settings.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-d83bdd852c5acb80","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8762","title":"RFC 8762: Simple Two-Way Active Measurement Protocol","titleEn":"RFC 8762: Simple Two-Way Active Measurement Protocol","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-12394b4a22706b67","url":"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/","title":"Principles of Digital Communications I","titleEn":"Principles of Digital Communications I","publisher":"MIT OpenCourseWare","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
